cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MacHelper, please cite it as below."
title: "MacHelper"
abstract: "A free, open-source, local-first menu bar app and command-line tool for Apple Silicon and Intel Macs: system monitor, fan control, cache cleaner, disk analyzer, and app uninstaller, with optional opt-in anonymous telemetry, a JSON CLI, redacted diagnostic reports (machelper report --json), and an agent skill for AI assistants."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/smile-minecraft/MacHelper"
url: "https://github.com/smile-minecraft/MacHelper"
keywords:
